WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:05.440
Ever wondered about the deepest desire of
SCP-529, the adorable Josie the Half-Cat?

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.870
Members of staff took a photo of her with
the Desire Camera while she was grooming herself.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.980
The resulting picture depicted her grooming
herself in a different position, but this

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.900
time, she had a complete body rather than
half of one.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.990
Awww, I made myself sad…

